#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:14
msgid "Sphinx i18n Infrastructure Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:16
msgid "Objective"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:18
msgid ""
"Set up the complete Sphinx internationalization infrastructure to support"
" locale-based documentation builds, starting with Spanish (es) and "
"designed for multi-locale expansion."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:20
msgid "Changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:22
msgid "`conf.py` — Add `locale_dirs`, `gettext_compact`, language selector config"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:23
msgid "`Makefile` — Add `gettext`, `intl-update`, `intl-build` targets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:24
msgid "`requirements.txt` — Add `sphinx-intl`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:25
msgid "`locale/es/LC_MESSAGES/` — Create directory structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:26
msgid "`.readthedocs.yml` — Configure multi-language build support"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:28
msgid "Acceptance Criteria"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:30
msgid ""
"`make gettext` successfully extracts .pot files from all 729 source files"
" (both .rst and .md)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:31
msgid "`sphinx-intl update -l es` generates .po files in `locale/es/LC_MESSAGES/`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:32
msgid ""
"`make html` with `language=es` builds successfully with untranslated .po "
"files (falls back to English)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:33
msgid "myst_parser Markdown files are correctly extracted to .pot format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:34
msgid ""
"`rst_prolog` substitutions are handled (product names remain English, "
"navigation paths extractable)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:35
msgid ""
"Directory structure supports adding additional locales (e.g., "
"`locale/fr/`, `locale/de/`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:36
msgid "Read the Docs configuration supports serving the Spanish build"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:38
msgid "Notes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:40
msgid ""
"Sphinx 4.2.0 gettext support is mature but myst_parser may need "
"`myst_gettext_mode` configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:41
msgid ""
"The `rst_prolog` has ~250 substitution definitions — test that these "
"don't generate noise in .pot files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.hero/specs/i18n-infrastructure/spec.md:42
msgid ""
"Consider whether `gettext_compact = False` (one .pot per source file) or "
"`True` (one .pot per top-level dir) is better for the AI pipeline"
msgstr ""

